  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS: <br>- 3 to 5-minute walk to beach<br>- Private pool <br>- Adjacent to the Rosemary Beach racquet club<br>- Steps away from local shopping and dining at Rosemary Beach and along 30Ave<br>- Multiple balconies with outdoor dining<br>- Premium Wi-Fi with extenders on every floor<br>- 6 adult bikes<br>- 2 gas grills<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - All linens, including comforter covers, laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: Barefoot Blue (formally Villa Cayman) is a beautiful 5-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom home boasting 4 bedrooms, a double bunk room, and 1 sleeper sofa with room for 14 people. It's perfectly situated between Inlet and Rosemary Beach, just a short walk from upscale boutiques and restaurants. The private courtyard features a pool and grill area. Simply put, the name \"Barefoot Blue\" says a lot!<br><br>Guests will enjoy the well-equipped chef's kitchen offering stainless steel appliances, designer quartz countertops, ample storage space, plenty of small appliances for the chef, and a coffee machine and complimentary ground coffee for brewing single pods or large carafe. The nearby counter height island-dining table seats 6. Neutral soothing tones, blue accents, artwork, and plush furnishings create a tranquil ambiance in the living room, which seats 6. Additional seating on the patio allows for a wonderful vacation.<br><br>On the second floor, you will find 2 guest rooms featuring a king bed and a private bathroom with a shower/tub combo in one and an oversized walk-in shower in the other. The bunk room has 2 twin-over-twin bunk beds offering a cozy getaway with its own TV.<br>The third floor has a primary king suite, both offering a shower and separate soaking tub. Each floor offers a large balcony that can be accessed from all bedrooms and provides seating and privacy with beautiful views of the pool and trees. <br><br>The outdoor oasis boasts a sparkling, private pool with a sunning bay surrounded by chaise lounge chairs and an outdoor dining set. There is plenty of seating for the entire party of 12. Take a 5-minute walk to the sugar-white sand beach and sparkling emerald waters just minutes by foot, or to the local shops and dining in the center of Rosemary Beach. 6 adult beach cruiser bikes provide a great way to see the sights in our wonderful 30A coastal towns. Barefoot Blue is the perfect place for your next coastal getaway. Book your stay now!<br><br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS:<br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/ Tub Combo<br>- Bunk Bedroom: 2 Twin-over-Twin Bunkbeds <br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower and Tub Separate<br><br>CARRIAGE HOUSE:<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Living Area: Queen Sleeper Sofa<br><br>*Garage is not for guest use.<br>*Home utilizes smart Tv features and does not have basic cable.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
